{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'pwd && rg -n \"recovery|retained|history_incomplete|independent jobs\" /Users/jim/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md'","aggregated_output":"/private/var/folders/rz/r6wxvr0n15d906k2s0jw8j2h0000gn/T/stdo-skills-recovery-980mjkdm/codex/workspace\n55:- “Memory is an artifact of prior computation whose retained differences modify the space of subsequent transformations.” “Data is the distinguishable residue of prior computation, embodied in a form that can condition subsequent computation.” [Task 1]\n77:- GTL, ABG, STDO, formal model, candidate-only projection, qualified view, continuation-sensitive preservation, complete presentation environment, retained terms, fixed-Γ, typed annotations\n82:- The case establishes fixed-Γ preservation and ordinary statefulness, not emergence. A resolver proof must quantify over the complete presentation environment, including retained terms and qualified references, not merely historical assets. [Task 1]\n271:- when the user says “theres nothing on the laptop that cant be recovered” -> focus on repair assessment, fees, depot/onsite logistics, and coverage rather than repeatedly foregrounding data recovery. [Task 1]\n358:- The common archive passed bounded custody/portable verification and exact recovery, but remained locally reviewable with `semantic_acceptance: not_issued`, `publication: not_performed`, actual-use unperformed, and HTML interaction unverified. [Task 2]\n407:- T-008, Graphify, F_D, E10, E11, inherited applicable failure, Writer replay, claim marker, Product/principal/request ID, `history_incomplete`, ac_support_core.py, ac_support_effects.py\n416:- E11 occurs when a Writer loses only its claim marker: a changed body/policy with the same Product/principal/request ID can receive the old success. Bind complete original request, Product/principal, and policy identity before claim/replay/recovery; missing stable owner history returns `history_incomplete`, never fresh planning or writing. [Task 1]\n422:- symptom: a missing claim marker authorizes conflicting identity reuse -> cause: replay identity was not bound to original request/policy and missing owner history was treated as availability -> fix: conservatively return `history_incomplete`. [Task 1]\n459:# Task Group: ABIogenesis T-287 retained-installed consumer preparation and RC1 qualification boundary\n461:scope: Use when resuming T-287/GOAL-035 from a handoff, repairing installed consumer/preparation and historical recovery, or reporting exactly what remains before RC1 qualification.\n474:## Task 2: Repair retained-installed consumer/preparation and historical recovery, success\n478:- rollout_summaries/2026-09-29T15-14-42-7gWO-abiogenesis_consumer_reuse_repair_accepted_rc1_open.md (cwd=/Users/jim/src/apps, rollout_path=/Users/jim/.codex/sessions/2026/09/30/rollout-2026-09-30T01-14-42-01a0edbb-7c4f-7493-bf06-2a600644bbb6.jsonl, updated_at=2026-10-05T02:00:55+00:00, thread_id=01a0edbb-7c4f-7493-bf06-2a600644bbb6, independently accepted bounded consumer-preparation/recovery cut)\n482:- T287_REUSE_CONSUMER_REPAIR_04, retained-installed-consumer.mjs, prepare-retained-setup-binding.mjs, eventless View, read_only_unchanged, completeAbgEventResource, artifact_unreadable, qualification_declaration_selection_unbound, Result/J\n503:- The accepted `T287_REUSE_CONSUMER_REPAIR_04` proof covered two eventless native View calls, canonical selected-resource/Task/request/renderer preparation, immutable Task reuse, crossed/missing refusal checks, and fresh historical Result/J recovery. It used actual published transport outcomes and native selection/currentness guards. [Task 2]\n506:- Accepted scope is private component preparation plus eventless/non-advancing native consumption and controlled historical recovery. Remaining work includes Public preparation, installed known-failure/citation -> F11 -> sole AF22 -> fresh-read conservation, genuine F11 defects, exact final qualification, and RC1 publication/owner acceptance. [Task 3]\n547:- `odd_manager` owns bounded admission/read models and operator presentation; ABIogenesis owns events, replay semantics, Run truth, and liveness. The slice supplies identity-first discovery, per-Run status, bounded event pages, and lazy call detail. Key seams: `build_tenants/react_vite/src/server/abg-event-carrier-service.mjs`, `retained-run-observation-service.mjs`, `src/contracts/abg-run-observation.ts`, browser ingress validation, and `runtime/tests/test_t046_current_run_observation.mjs`. [Task 1]\n602:- ABIogenesis, code review, last 2 days of work, uncommitted-work, git status --porcelain=v1, git log --since='2 days ago', file mtimes, qualification contraction, retained-transition reuse, cold-record decoder, public readback, native workspace execution, GTL, HoG, ABG, Event Calculus, T-287\n699:# Task Group: ABIogenesis recovery after review-to-execution drift, selected commentary restoration, and post lookup\n701:scope: Use after an authorized ABIogenesis recovery from a rejected development cut, when restoring only selected archived commentary, or when locating the restored four-dimensional lifecycle post.\n708:- rollout_summaries/2026-08-20T17-35-12-O9s1-abiogenesis_review_recovery_commentary_restore_four_dimensio.md (cwd=/Users/jim, rollout_path=/Users/jim/.codex/sessions/2026/08/21/rollout-2026-08-21T03-35-12-01a0203d-bee7-76e3-b8dd-c95628587d2d.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-30T04:56:48+00:00, thread_id=01a0203d-bee7-76e3-b8dd-c95628587d2d, rejected dev.287 was archived and main restored to stable dev.286)\n718:- rollout_summaries/2026-08-20T17-35-12-O9s1-abiogenesis_review_recovery_commentary_restore_four_dimensio.md (cwd=/Users/jim, rollout_path=/Users/jim/.codex/sessions/2026/08/21/rollout-2026-08-21T03-35-12-01a0203d-bee7-76e3-b8dd-c95628587d2d.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-30T04:56:48+00:00, thread_id=01a0203d-bee7-76e3-b8dd-c95628587d2d, exact archival blob restoration and pushed parity verification)\n728:- rollout_summaries/2026-08-20T17-35-12-O9s1-abiogenesis_review_recovery_commentary_restore_four_dimensio.md (cwd=/Users/jim, rollout_path=/Users/jim/.codex/sessions/2026/08/21/rollout-2026-08-21T03-35-12-01a0203d-bee7-76e3-b8dd-c95628587d2d.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-30T04:56:48+00:00, thread_id=01a0203d-bee7-76e3-b8dd-c95628587d2d, current-main tracked-file lookup)\n737:- when development fails, the user prefers tagged-main recovery: branch it “for posterity/selective poaching,” reset to the last stable tag, then continue from there; preserve named stable releases such as `4.6.0-rc.3`. [Task 1]\n743:- Stable recovery pattern: archive a failed candidate under a descriptive remote branch, verify archive containment, reset `main` to the last stable immutable tag, then clean redundant branches/worktrees only with authorization. [Task 1]\n763:- rollout_summaries/2026-08-20T17-35-12-O9s1-abiogenesis_review_recovery_commentary_restore_four_dimensio.md (cwd=/Users/jim, rollout_path=/Users/jim/.codex/sessions/2026/08/21/rollout-2026-08-21T03-35-12-01a0203d-bee7-76e3-b8dd-c95628587d2d.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-30T04:56:48+00:00, thread_id=01a0203d-bee7-76e3-b8dd-c95628587d2d, timestamp-prefixed commentary navigation)\n857:- rollout_summaries/2026-08-20T17-35-12-O9s1-abiogenesis_review_recovery_commentary_restore_four_dimensio.md (cwd=/Users/jim, rollout_path=/Users/jim/.codex/sessions/2026/08/21/rollout-2026-08-21T03-35-12-01a0203d-bee7-76e3-b8dd-c95628587d2d.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-30T04:56:48+00:00, thread_id=01a0203d-bee7-76e3-b8dd-c95628587d2d, review-only overlay analysis did not reach a final verdict)\n1122:- Proposed probes are the neutral sum-and-histogram categorical steel thread, uncertain-effect recovery, and bounded ordinary triage/ticket/release tasks using a common oracle and selected frames. The proposed 90-minute-per-assessor/USD-10 envelope and reported ~32,600-token scratch experiment remain proposal/exploratory evidence, not an authorized spend grant or qualification. [Task 2]\n1127:- symptom: document counts, syntax/link checks, successful maps, copied-text percentage, or URI count are called proof -> cause: mechanical evidence was substituted for semantic conservation, foundational integration, or qualification -> fix: inspect changed semantic boundaries, permissions, conditions, negative results, authority, retained distinctions, and explicit conditional foundation/work-recovery contracts. [Task 2]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
